[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300600_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300600_02_0010","text":"辛苦啦～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300600_02_0011","text":"艺人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300600_02_0020","text":"啊，雏菜！抱歉～……！\n占了桌子……我马上把参考书收起来"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300600_02_0030","text":"啊～\n完全没关系哦～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300600_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300600_02_0040","text":"──我啊\n现在在为短大入学考试学习呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300600_02_0050","text":"工作也在减少\n真的感觉我的将来会怎样啊，就是这种状态……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300600_02_0060","text":"诶～……\n是这样啊～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300600_02_0070","text":"……啊，我得走了\n抱歉，东西摊了一桌"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300600_02_0080","text":"雏菜也要\n好好考虑将来的事才行哦！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300600_02_0090","text":"好～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300600_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300600_02_0092","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300600_02_0100","text":"────雏菜，为什么被说了呢～？"}]
